    rdf:value """J anuary 1905  Monday 2
Lunch Gilbert Murray at Alys’
At Ivy Lodge.
January 1905  Tuesday 3
Call on Mrs. Sandars 
Call on Ricketts
Logan up
January 1905  Wednesday 4
